TEXT 48 -96 Left 2 ;Channel 2: Sallen-Key high-pass filter (tweeter)  -  2N7000 source follower, fc = 1.07 kHz
TEXT 1488 32 Left 2 ;+9 V supply and decoupling (Table 1)
TEXT 48 -56 Left 2 ;TESTBENCH: Channel 2 high-pass - 1 Vpp sine stepped over the Table 3 frequencies. Results: View > SPICE Error Log (steps 1-9 = 50, 100, 200, 500, 1k, 1070, 2k, 5k, 10k Hz)
TEXT 48 520 Left 2 !.param f=1k
TEXT 48 616 Left 2 ;Test 1 (active): Table 2 DC voltages and Table 3 Vpp / gain
TEXT 48 648 Left 2 !.step param f list 50 100 200 500 1k 1070 2k 5k 10k\n.tran 0 {0.2+10/f} 0.2 {1/(200*f)}\n.meas TRAN Vin_pp PP V(in)\n.meas TRAN Vout_pp PP V(out)\n.meas TRAN Gain PARAM Vout_pp/Vin_pp\n.meas TRAN V_gate AVG V(gate)\n.meas TRAN V_source AVG V(source)\n.meas TRAN V_rail_to_gate AVG V(VCC)-V(gate)
TEXT 880 616 Left 2 ;Test 2 (Bode plot / cutoff): right-click each block, swap Comment <-> SPICE directive
TEXT 880 648 Left 2 ;.ac dec 100 10 100k\n.meas AC G_pass MAX mag(V(out))\n.meas AC f_3dB WHEN mag(V(out))=G_pass/sqrt(2)\n.meas AC G_1070 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 1070\n.meas AC Ph_1070 FIND ph(V(out)) AT 1070
